🚀 Feature
PyTorch should enable "readability-braces-around-statements" in its clang-tidy checks.
Motivation
Currently, PyTorch clang-tidy test doesn't enable "readability-braces-around-statements" check on the cpp code.
For example, https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/blob/master/torch/csrc/autograd/init.cpp#L14 doesn't have braces around the if-then branch statement.
Pitch
This should not pass clang-tidy test:
if (condition)
    statement;
But this should:
if (condition) {
  statement;
}
